<title>USA: Atec Group Inc Q2 Dec 31 net EPS flat.</title>
<headline>Atec Group Inc Q2 Dec 31 net EPS flat.</headline>
<dateline>EAST NORTHPORT, N.Y., eb. 5</dateline>
<text>
<p>For 3 Mos Ended	   For 6 Mos Ended</p>
<p>		   12/31/96    12/31/95    12/31/96  12/31/95 (a)</p>
<p> Net revenues $25,783,789 $22,655,261 $51,422,875 $36,934,945</p>
<p> Net income	 363,797     305,095     764,427     465,986</p>
<p> Net EPS		  .01	   .01	   .03	   .03</p>
<p>Common shrs</p>
<p>(fully diluted) 25,160,473 20,511,500 25,160,473 17,216,200</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Innovative Business Micros Inc, which ATEC acquired in June 1996, changed its fiscal year end from Sept. 30 to June 30.  If Innovative first quarter results were included in the fiscal 1996 year, revenues would have been $41.5 million with net income of $512,000 or three cents per share.  Shares outstanding include the shares issued for the acquisition.</p>
</text>
